{"title":"Giant Spider","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 8 Spider that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/giant-spider\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/giant-spider?lv=8\">Lv 8 <span>77</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/giant-spider?lv=20\">Lv 20 <span>113</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/giant-spider?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>11</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/giant-spider?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>11</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/giant-spider?lv=24\">Lv 24 <span>10</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/giant-spider?lv=32\">Lv 32 <span>8</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/giant-spider?lv=8\" title=\"Pick level 8\"><td><b>8</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>26</td><td>8.9</td><td>400</td><td class=\"muted\">78 · 12.5 · 1,200</td><td>77</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/giant-spider?lv=20\" title=\"Pick level 20\"><td><b>20</b></td><td>66</td><td>15.5</td><td>1,000</td><td class=\"muted\">198 · 21.7 · 3,000</td><td>113</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Trove\">Sunken Trove</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/giant-spider\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>21</b></td><td>70</td><td>16.1</td><td>1,050</td><td class=\"muted\">210 · 22.5 · 3,150</td><td>11</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Outpost\">Thak Scout Outpost</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/giant-spider?lv=22\" title=\"Pick level 22\"><td><b>22</b></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</td><td class=\"muted\">222 · 23.2 · 3,300</td><td>11</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Outpost\">Thak Scout Outpost</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/giant-spider?lv=24\" title=\"Pick level 24\"><td><b>24</b></td><td>84</td><td>17.7</td><td>1,200</td><td class=\"muted\">252 · 24.8 · 3,600</td><td>10</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/giant-spider?lv=32\" title=\"Pick level 32\"><td><b>32</b></td><td>131</td><td>22.1</td><td>1,600</td><td class=\"muted\">393 · 30.9 · 4,800</td><td>8</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"giant-spider\" data-map-level=\"21\">Show level 21 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 13 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"spider-silk\" title=\"Spider Silk - in 12 of 13 looted corpses, 11 recorded drops, 29 total, 1–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/0b2636b90d57ad14912f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Spider Silk</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.1<br>×1–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-poti